-5b05-aa1e-8ab347e93c79","source_start_index":48,"source_text":"二十年，秦复与我河外及封陵以和。"},{"context_after":"汉有司盐都尉治此，因名司盐城。或曰：唐大历中，于县西南三...","context_before":"司盐城[县西二十里。《括地志》：故盐氏城也。","source_end_index":57,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"90e12588-878d-52be-9603-b06d54ec25a3","source_start_index":22,"source_text":"《秦纪》：昭襄王十一年，齐、韩、魏、赵、宋、中山，共攻秦，至盐氏而还。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事","外交"],"content":"2齊、韓、魏、趙、宋同擊秦，至鹽氏而還。秦與韓武遂、與魏封陵以和。","content_fanyi":"齐国、韩国、魏国、赵国、宋国一同出兵攻打秦国，进至盐氏邑后各自班师撤回。秦国把武遂归还给韩国，把封陵归还给魏国，以此讲和。","content_jianti_auto":"2齐、韩、魏、赵、宋同击秦，至盐氏而还。秦与韩武遂、与魏封陵以和。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":304,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c9b04e7-db0e-11ef-8dad-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c9b0504-db0e-11ef-8b8a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"中山","place_name_jianti_auto":"中山","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8c9b0505-db0e-11ef-b08e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"趙新取中山之地也。行，下孟翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"赵新取中山之地也。行，下孟翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8c9b0503-db0e-11ef-a779-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c9b0507-db0e-11ef-9778-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"林胡","place_name_jianti_auto":"林胡","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8c9b0508-db0e-11ef-8fdc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"樓煩","place_name_jianti_auto":"楼烦","place_note":"山西北部